[{"answer":"Yes, how can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to buy a campus parking pass for next year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Certainly. Did you want a limited or unlimited?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/3.mp3"},{"answer":"And just for fall quarter, or for the entire school year?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I was thinking of one for the whole year, but I'm not sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Does the year include summer quarter?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/6.mp3"},{"answer":"'Cause I won't be here then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/7.mp3"},{"answer":"No, summer term is extra.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/8.mp3"},{"answer":"The year includes fall, winter and spring quarters.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/9.mp3"},{"answer":"A yearly pass is valid only from the start of fall term to the end of spring term.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/10.mp3"},{"answer":"This year, that's, uh, let's see...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/11.mp3"},{"answer":"September 22nd to June 7th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/13.mp3"},{"answer":"And you said there were two different kinds? Uh, limited and unlimited?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. A limited pass lets you park in any campus lot only on days school is in session.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/15.mp3"},{"answer":"During holidays and on weekends, you would have to pay the normal parking rate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/16.mp3"},{"answer":"With an unlimited pass, you can park in any lot on any day during the school year,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/17.mp3"},{"answer":"including weekends and holidays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Like I said, between September 22nd and June 7th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... how much do they cost?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/20.mp3"},{"answer":"A limited pass is $100, and an unlimited pass is $150.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/21.mp3"},{"answer":"All right, I'll buy an unlimited, I guess.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/22.mp3"},{"answer":"What do I have to do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/23.mp3"},{"answer":"First, I'm going to give you a registration form.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/24.mp3"},{"answer":"This gives us information about your car.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Fill it out, and bring it back to me when you're ready.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/26.mp3"},{"answer":"You can pay by cash, check, or credit card.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Then, I'll give you a sticker to put on the corner of your windshield.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Make sure that sticker is in place when you park.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Otherwise, you will get a ticket.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/30.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/31.mp3"},{"answer":"So, um, does this pass guarantee that I'll get a parking space?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, are there, like, special places set aside in each lot for people with parking passes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/33.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a good question.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh, unfortunately, the answer is no.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Parking is on a first-come, first-serve basis.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/36.mp3"},{"answer":"If a lot is full, you'll have to park somewhere else,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/37.mp3"},{"answer":"or wait until another car leaves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/38.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/39.mp3"},{"answer":"How much does, um, regular parking cost? Without a pass?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/40.mp3"},{"answer":"It's $2 an hour, or $10 a day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/41.mp3"},{"answer":"You're getting an excellent deal.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, just one more question.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you need all the money up front, or can I make payments?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid I need it all at once. Sorry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-6-2023-01-19-00-05-26/46.mp3"}]
